er settings.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Third-Party Links<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Our site contains links to psychic platforms and services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your Rights<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. To exercise these rights, contact us at support@psychicdirectory.com.<\/p>\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Last updated: March 2026 Psychic Review Directory (&#8220;we,&#8221; &#8220;us,&#8221; or &#8220;our&#8221;) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you visit psychic-review-directory.com. Information We Collect We may collect information you provide directly, such as your [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\r\n<title>Privacy Policy - Psychic Review Directory<\/title>\r\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/privacy-policy\/\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Privacy Policy - Psychic Review Directory\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Last updated: March 2026 Psychic Review Directory (&#8220;we,&#8221; &#8220;us,&#8221; 